OL,3,GNEWSATrans changing room tribunal
OL,4,Anurses seek #400k costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FNurses whose complaints about a
OL,7,Ftransgender colleague using their
OL,8,Ffemale-only changing room led to a
OL,9,Ftribunal are seeking #400,000 in legal
OL,10,Fcosts from hospital bosses.
OL,12,FEmployment judges previously ruled
OL,13,FDarlington Memorial Hospital chiefs had
OL,14,F"violated the dignity" of female nurses
OL,15,Fby allowing a colleague - a biological
OL,16,Fmale who identified as a woman - to use
OL,17,Fthe single-sex changing area.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
