OL,3,GNEWSATrans changing room tribunal
OL,4,Anurses seek #400k costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a fresh hearing in Newcastle, the
OL,7,Fnurse's legal team said the trust had
OL,8,Fpersevered with a "hopeless" defence
OL,9,Fand had failed to engage with bids to
OL,10,Freach a settlement.
OL,12,FLawyers for County Durham and
OL,13,FDarlington NHS Foundation Trust said it
OL,14,Fhad been reasonable to defend the case.
